# 🌿 Sanchayam

> **Personal Life Management System (PLMS)**
> **Project Code:** JSNP (Jeevana Sanchaya Niyama Prabandham)

---

## Overview

**Sanchayam** is an offline-first, secure, modular desktop application designed to help individuals organize every important aspect of their personal and professional lives from a single place.

The vision behind Sanchayam is simple:

> **One application. One database. One trusted place for your life's information.**

Unlike a traditional expense tracker or daily planner, Sanchayam is designed as a long-term Personal Life Management System that grows with its user.

It begins as a personal productivity and finance application and can evolve into a complete life management platform with modules for assets, health, family records, farm management, business operations, and intelligent analytics.

---

# Vision

To build a secure, reliable, offline-first application that becomes the digital companion for managing an individual's complete life journey.

---

# Mission

Develop a modular desktop application that enables users to manage:

* Daily expenses
* Income
* Budget
* Calendar
* Tasks
* Reminders
* Journal
* Notes
* Personal documents
* Family information
* Health records
* Assets
* Farm operations
* Reports
* Future AI-assisted productivity

All while ensuring complete ownership of personal data.

---

# Core Principles

* Offline First
* Privacy by Design
* Security First
* Modular Architecture
* Production-Quality Code
* Clean User Experience
* Long-Term Maintainability
* Extensible Design

