# Security

Sanchayam is designed with privacy as a fundamental principle.

Features include:

* Offline Data Storage
* Password Authentication
* Encrypted Sensitive Data (planned)
* Automatic Backup
* Restore Functionality
* Audit Logging
* Secure Configuration
* Optional Cloud Synchronization (future)

---

# Technology Stack

| Component       | Technology     |
| --------------- | -------------- |
| Language        | Python         |
| UI Framework    | PySide6        |
| Database        | SQLite         |
| ORM             | SQLAlchemy     |
| Reporting       | ReportLab      |
| Excel Export    | OpenPyXL       |
| Charts          | Plotly         |
| Scheduler       | APScheduler    |
| Logging         | Python Logging |
| Testing         | pytest         |
| Packaging       | PyInstaller    |
| Version Control | Git            |

