# Development Philosophy

This project follows professional software engineering practices.

* Clean Architecture
* SOLID Principles
* Repository Pattern
* Service Layer
* Modular Design
* Comprehensive Documentation
* Automated Testing
* Continuous Improvement

Temporary solutions and throwaway code are avoided. Every implementation should be maintainable, scalable, and suitable for production.

